# Cho'chqa ikonlari — qat'iy taqiq

Hech qachon quyidagilarni ishlatmang:

- `Icons.savings`, `Icons.savings_outlined`, `Icons.savings_rounded` (va boshqa `savings*`)
- `Icons.account_balance_wallet`, `Icons.account_balance_wallet_outlined`, `Icons.account_balance_wallet_rounded`

Bular Material Design cho'chqa / hamyon ramzlari; foydalanuvchi ularni ilovada ko'rishni xohlamaydi.

## O'rniga

`lib/theme/gap_icons.dart` dagi [GapIcons] dan foydalaning:

- Brend / jamg'armalar: `GapIcons.brand`, `GapIcons.brandOutlined`
- Pul / to'lov: `GapIcons.payments`, `GapIcons.paymentsOutlined`
- Guruhlar: `GapIcons.groups`

Admin panelda `savings` / `wallet` icon nomlari API orqali kelsa ham, `iconNameToIconData` ularni xavfsiz ikonlarga map qiladi.
